Flute Intro:[Bm]..[G]..[A]..[F#]

[Bm]Zindagi se churaake

[A]zindagi mein basaake

[G]zindagani banaya hai tu [F#]jhe..[Bm]roothe rab ko manaake

[A]aasmaan ko jhukaake

[G]zindagani banaya hai tu [F#]jhe..[Bm]Tu mila jiss tarah sabah miley

[G]tu mila jiss tarah silah miley

[A]tu mila jiss tarah dua miley ba [F#]khudaa

[Bm]Tu mila toh jaise main jee gaya

[G]tu mila mukhamal main ho gaya

[A]tu mila toh faila hai noor sa ba [F#]khudaa

Zindagi se churaake part repeat

Piano Lead:[Bm]..[G]..[A]..[F#]

[Bm]Mehfooz tu mehsoos kar

tere paas hoon main [A]sada

[A]Tujhse nahi ho sakta main

